的时候显然怎么改都能保证连续；当序列中有多个数的时候，因为一个序列若满足连续，那么这个序列的首项和末项之差为\r\n<span class=\"math inline\"><em>n</em> − 1</span>，而且给我们能填入的数字都他相近的两个数，也就是说在这里我们只能让这个差值更小，所以我们只能在原序列差值小于等于\r\n<span class=\"math inline\"><em>n</em> − 1</span>\r\n的时候才能修改得到一个满足连续的序列。</p>\r\n<div class=\"sourceCode\" id=\"cb2\"><pre class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><code class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><span id=\"cb2-1\"><a href=\"#cb2-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>CI MXX<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"fl\">2e5</span><span class=\"op\">+</span><span class=\"dv\">5</span><span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-2\"><a href=\"#cb2-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-3\"><a href=\"#cb2-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"dt\">int</span> n<span class=\"op\">,</span>a<span class=\"op\">[</span>MXX<span class=\"op\">];</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-4\"><a href=\"#cb2-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-5\"><a href=\"#cb2-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>S main<span class=\"op\">()</span> <span class=\"op\">{</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-6\"><a href=\"#cb2-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    Files<span class=\"op\">();</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-7\"><a href=\"#cb2-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-8\"><a href=\"#cb2-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"dt\">int</span> T<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-9\"><a href=\"#cb2-9\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    fr<span class=\"op\">(</span>T<span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-10\"><a href=\"#cb2-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-11\"><a href=\"#cb2-11\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">while</span><span class=\"op\">(</span>T<span class=\"op\">--)</span> <span class=\"op\">{</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-12\"><a href=\"#cb2-12\" aria-hidden=\"tr